+++
title: Followership resources
pointers: Commit out loud, even when you disagreed. | Bring the problem and a way forward. | Know what you'd leave over.
teaser: On supporting a direction you didn't set, without losing your own voice.
+++

Notes for anyone who does their best work in support of someone else's
vision: how to disagree usefully, how to commit once a call is made, and
how to choose who is worth following.
